  "message": "My information: A has positive interpersonal skills and experience, and negative personal skills. B has negative personal skills, positive experience, and positive intelligence. C has positive interpersonal skills, negative personal skills, and negative motivation. Combining this with Participant 1’s information, B has all five characteristics known: three positive and two negative, for strength 4. C has two positive and three negative, for strength 1. A’s intelligence is still unknown; A ties B if it is positive and falls behind if it is negative.",
